
CASE STUDY 3: Hospital Billing and Patient Classification

1. Problem Statement:
Process consultation, diagnostic, and treatment charges, apply conditional concessions, validate billing constraints, and classify patients according to a supplied payment policy[cite: 1].

2. Objectives:
Automate medical billing calculations and patient tier classification based on demographic concessions[cite: 1].

3. Assumptions:
Senior citizens (age 60 and above) receive a 15% concession discount on total hospital charges[cite: 1].

4. Algorithm:
Step 1: Input patient details including name, age, consultation fee, diagnostic fee, and treatment fee[cite: 1].
Step 2: Calculate the subtotal by summing up all individual fees[cite: 1].
Step 3: Use a conditional statement to check if age is >= 60[cite: 1].
Step 4: Apply a 15% discount multiplier if the condition is true; otherwise, keep the discount at 0%[cite: 1].
Step 5: Compute final net payable amount and assign patient classification tier[cite: 1].
Step 6: Print detailed hospital invoice statement[cite: 1].

5. Flowchart (Textual):
Start -> Input Patient Details -> Sum Charges (Subtotal) -> Check Age >= 60 -> [True: Apply 15% Discount / False: No Discount] -> Calculate Final Bill -> Determine Patient Tier -> Print Invoice -> End.

6. Pseudocode:
READ patient_name, age, consultation, diagnostic, treatment
SET subtotal = consultation + diagnostic + treatment
IF age >= 60:
    SET discount = 0.15
    SET classification = "Senior Concession Tier"
ELSE:
    SET discount = 0.0
    SET classification = "Standard General Tier"
ENDIF
SET final_payable = subtotal * (1 - discount)
PRINT invoice statement

7. Python Source Code:
# Hospital Billing and Patient Classification System
patient_name = "Robert Smith"
patient_age = 65
consultation_fee = 150.0
diagnostic_fee = 300.0
treatment_fee = 1200.0

# Compute subtotal
subtotal_charges = consultation_fee + diagnostic_fee + treatment_fee

# Conditional age concession and patient classification
if patient_age >= 60:
    discount_rate = 0.15
    patient_tier = "Senior Concession Tier"
else:
    discount_rate = 0.0
    patient_tier = "Standard General Tier"

# Calculate final payable amount
discount_amount = subtotal_charges * discount_rate
final_payable = subtotal_charges - discount_amount

print("========================================")
print("     HOSPITAL BILLING STATEMENT         ")
print("========================================")
print(f"Patient Name         : {patient_name}")
print(f"Age                  : {patient_age} years")
print(f"Patient Classification: {patient_tier}")
print(f"Subtotal Charges     : ${subtotal_charges:.2f}")
print(f"Concession Applied   : {discount_rate * 100}% (${discount_amount:.2f})")
print(f"Final Payable Amount : ${final_payable:.2f}")
